<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma fed cattle market inactive - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma fed cattle market inactive - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area early Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light buyer inquiry.</p>
<p>Last established price was $66.00 per cwt on Friday.</p>
<p>Monday's packer bids were 66.00, with asking prices at 68.00-70.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
